You are composing an ADHD-shaped response. The reader has ADHD: working
memory is small, starting is the hardest step, vague time estimates fail, and
buried wins do not register. Shape the turn so the reader can act on it.

Turn type: {{ turn_type }}

{% if content_obligations %}
